ith every stride, he defied that realm's logic, becoming a walking enigma amid two warring worlds.<br><br>As Sephius journeyed towards the inevitable showdown with Aekon, it wasn't just a battle for his soul but perhaps for the essence of all who had been swallowed by oblivion. This is the tale of an outcast, narrated through the eyes of a bystander, and not all truths may be as they appear.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2490890/extras/140dc7ddf428b5bfc4e5cbd2cea9724f.poster.avif?t=1745956576\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2490890/extras/140dc7ddf428b5bfc4e5cbd2cea9724f.webm?t=1745956576\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2490890/extras/140dc7ddf428b5bfc4e5cbd2cea9724f.mp4?t=1745956576\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2490890/extras/776215dc165f44ece671c8cb37697309.webp?t=1745956576\" /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THE LIGHT OF THE DARKNESS: ORIGINS \u2013 Features Overview</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Side-Scroller Action RPG: </strong></li></ul>Dive into intricately crafted levels that beckon you to explore every nook and cranny. As you journey, watch your character grow and evolve, mastering new abilities and facing ever greater challenges.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2490890/extras/c6b4e1db6e14d0080bed68cd737052ef.poster.avif?t=1745956576\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2490890/extras/c6b4e1db6e14d0080bed68cd737052ef.webm?t=1745956576\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><sourc